        "title": "The graph below shows the percentage of the Australian workforce in five industries between 1962 and 2012. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QCIAd9Cs6oChx4xVpPdliNFegbg\"><em><strong>The graph below shows the percentage of the Australian workforce in five industries between 1962 and 2012. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Australian Workforce by Industry: 1962&ndash;2012</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N64jd9FvgoRfDTx2p91lBNjJgRc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TqPldEHP5oO9Eqxr2kRlefpxgtb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QKBNd1jy0oifaXxd7O7lBfgkgme\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong><a href=\"https://rebrand.ly/task-1-line-charts\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">Giới thiệu dạng Line Graphs</span></a></strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G9QodMYFLoXNa5xZ9D7lQv6Agob\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i Australian Workforce by Industry: 1962&ndash;2012 y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về tỷ lệ phần trăm lực lượng lao động trong năm lĩnh vực kh&aacute;c nhau tại &Uacute;c trong khoảng thời gian từ 1962 đến 2012.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EhTZdRfaIoPeSmx7fhalWn1kgRd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch<a href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuong-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\"> <strong><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">tả số liệu 'tương đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</span></strong></a> trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong> </strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WfTZd98FdoHyIQxwQxSlKRktgBc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Australian Workforce by Industry: 1962&ndash;2012 với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: phần trăm người đi l&agrave;m - năm lĩnh vực - nền kinh tế &Uacute;c - 50 năm từ 1962 - 2012.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NFMNd7CCUoHbx0xGeyHlsRKwgLr\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Học c&aacute;ch viết Introduction</strong> cho <strong>tất cả</strong> c&aacute;c b&agrave;i dạng <strong>Line Graphs</strong> ở đ&acirc;y bạn nh&eacute; &rarr;<strong> </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/intro-line\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">C&aacute;ch viết Introduction dạng LINE</a></strong></span></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IFf1dMjRDok8HtxlXSUlI37OgGb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HBJLdorasotac9xk723lTjoAg9g\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WX6Hd7eA8odriFxhJAKlIfzzgKd\">Theo&nbsp;<strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QBnbdo4JaoTPD0xpPZMleNOsgec\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Trends: </strong>services tăng, trong khi manufacturing, agiculture, construction, v&agrave; mining th&igrave; hầu như kh&ocirc;ng đổi.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DzDzd7l31o5efExHYL2lnSfagug\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Differences: </strong>services lu&ocirc;n lu&ocirc;n cao nhất.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZrvgdhtrQovJnNxqKVSl5FLhgxe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Iv2pdg97YoEmwkx8LjKlzkbhgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FDEMd2TadoWZ8SxhKAElWam3guf\">Theo&nbsp;<strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; sự tương đồng, cụ thể như sau:</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Iv2pdg97YoEmwkx8LjKlzkbhgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DnlrdxVnmoBjaHxokUVl6LLPgVB\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DnlrdxVnmoBjaHxokUVl6LLPgVB\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IOFadYWaZoMwWZx0SUHlIGpVgvd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> services v&agrave; manufacturing</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O9RxduljBoP4ylx310PlJVMCg0e\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N41JdM7MjoHQl2xFPG7lbHTjgMg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 1962 </strong><em>(services l&agrave; 52%, </em><em><strong>cao gấp đ&ocirc;i</strong></em><em> so với manufacturing với 25%)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T7U5dheF2oOdzKxqiGelD0zyg7M\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của services </strong>(<em><strong>tăng từ từ </strong></em><em>đến 75% v&agrave;o năm 2012)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CwRZd0o2GoXuQ3xAKTdliYm7gfb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của manufacturing </strong><em>(</em><em><strong>giảm li&ecirc;n tục </strong></em><em>xuống 10% năm 2012)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XLrldOBdEoLn16xoLpzlJ9prgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XLrldOBdEoLn16xoLpzlJ9prgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IkHpdNhgAo2VEjxKgjYlZDocgxe\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: Ba</strong><strong> ng&agrave;nh c&ograve;n lại</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Tw5QdMsmgo3Bf8xkcK5lDu6OgZo\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Te4vdy7NMoqrLWxF60YlBQ7NgSK\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 1962 </strong><em>(agriculture chiếm 12%, so với construction chiếm 10%)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XUROdzq5xoDYXUxxaN8lcNUWgVg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của agriculture </strong><em>(</em><em><strong>giảm nhẹ </strong></em><em>đạt</em><em><strong> </strong></em><em>4% v&agrave;o năm 2012)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LEhCd09Jrofx1ox4LWrlQKkwgfe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của construction </strong><em>(</em><em><strong>kh&aacute; ổn định</strong></em><em><strong> </strong></em><em>kết th&uacute;c ở mức 10% năm 2012)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MzrcdOLwiojdbzxPqwolldyUgGd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 4) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>mining </strong><em>(lu&ocirc;n l&agrave; số nhỏ nhất, <strong>dao động</strong> 1-2% trong xuy&ecirc;n suốt giai đoạn)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XLrldOBdEoLn16xoLpzlJ9prgzd\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E6Q5dNsjTogsZxxKU2qlf4WmgLb\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2MCdvXR5oooHCxOvw2lEnlngwd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MnbpdAp5corb72xFVRvlgDNogSg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Khi muốn diễn đạt&nbsp;<strong>\"phần trăm của lực lượng lao động\"</strong>, thay v&igrave; viết <strong>\"the proportion of workforce\"</strong>, m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể d&ugrave;ng <strong>\"the proportion of workers employed\"</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JG9idnlwgoWMalxwfUclgdkXgjf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ:</strong><strong> </strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YYwxdNB3wo0hjlxvlWhlXI3ogTb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">The line graph illustrates the proportion of workers employed in five different sectors of the Australian economy over a 50-year period from 1962 to 2012.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 419,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UFIZd01WiorKgtxKRjkl21UdgTh\">The line graph illustrates the proportion of workers employed in five different sectors of the Australian economy over a 50-year period from 1962 to 2012.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13792,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 420,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LZqedtzTDo4FrBxJbuIlVCnwgIb\">Overall, while the service sector witnessed a substantial upward trend throughout the period shown, manufacturing experienced a significant decline. Additionally, services consistently remained the highest-employing sector, while the remaining three industries maintained relatively stable but low percentages of the total workforce.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13792,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 421,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxmPduv06oxWE9xXtp1lTOkWgWf\">Looking at the two dominant sectors, in 1962, the service sector employed approximately 53% of the workforce, which was about twice the figure for manufacturing, at 27%. Subsequently, the service sector then experienced a steady increase over the following decades, reaching around 78% by 2012. In contrast, manufacturing showed a continuous downward trend, particularly sharp between 1972 and 1992, before settling at roughly 11% in the final year.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13792,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 422,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AWigdbgxnoRwFaxl8qelbbosgcg\">Regarding the other three industries, in 1962, the agricultural sector accounted for 12% of Australia's workforce, compared to 10% employed in the construction industry. Thereafter, while agricultural employment declined slightly to about 4% by 2012, the construction sector remained relatively stable, ending the period at approximately 10%. Mining consistently accounted for the smallest share of employment, showing minimal variation between 1% and 2% throughout the entire period.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13792,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
